+## Attempt 5: Boundary integer types and simplification
+
+Purpose: check signed/unsigned boundary rewrites and pruning.
+
+```sql
+DROP TABLE IF EXISTS bounds;
+CREATE TABLE bounds AS
+SELECT
+    i::BIGINT AS id,
+    ((i % 256) - 128)::TINYINT AS ti,
